    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that all three new templates will be live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time for the 2 November campaign to link to them. Finance’s wording for reverse charge invoices, the end-of-month switch-over aim, turning off the old templates, and the preview link for the referral block were stated but remain without a confirmed resolution in these items.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Hannah, Tomasz and Aiko that all three new templates will be live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time for the 2 November campaign to link to them, with the recheck passed.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Finance still owed the wording for reverse charge invoices for the tax copy.\n- Finance would be chased today.\n- Tomasz was asked whether aiming for end of month for the full switch-over would work.\n- End of month should be doable if finance replies this week.\n- End of month would be planned around.\n- End of month should be doable if finance replies this week.\n- Tomasz was asked to turn off the old templates once the switch is done so both are not sent.\n- The old templates would be deleted from the sender config after a day of clean sends.\n- A preview link for the referral block was requested for Legal to read the terms in context.\n- A preview link would be sent this afternoon.\n- The campaign copy is with the translators so the referral wording cannot be changed after this week.\n- The wording would be kept frozen."
